  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PostgreSQLOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to PostgreSQL — the world's most advanced open-source relational database. Stores OASIS holons and avatars using Npgsql (ADO.NET) with indexed lookup columns and full JSON serialisation. Compatible with PostgreSQL 12+ and managed services (Supabase, Neon, RDS, Azure). Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(NileOASIS): run Nile on the PostgreSQL provider's full Npgsql implementation (4c319cc)\n- feat(providers): add PostgreSQL, Firebase, Supabase, and Cloudflare KV OASIS providers (01ccfdc)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PostgreSQLOASIS",
